<section aria-labelledby="<%= guideline_anchor(:series) %>">
  <h2 id="<%= guideline_anchor(:series) %>">6. Series</h2>
  <p>
    A series is a product line that the brand gives a name, for example <i>Heritage</i> by
    Klipsch or <i>Evolution</i> by Fezz Audio.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Do not add the brand name to the series: write <i>Heritage</i>, not <i>Klipsch Heritage</i>.</li>
    <li>The series name is shown next to the product name. Do not add it to the names of the products in the series: write <i>Omega Lupi</i>, not <i>Evolution Omega Lupi</i>.</li>
    <li>Do not create a series for the different versions of one product (Mk I, Mk II). Add each of them as a separate product.</li>
    <li>Do not create a series for a category, for example "Klipsch speakers".</li>
  </ul>
</section>
